        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "A decrease in the revenue of the managed clinics (including the franchisee and other alliance clinics) as a result of such adverse economic conditions would directly result in a reduction of the Company’s revenue since we receive substantial revenue from the MCs as part of our compensation for management services.",
