        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "A decrease in the revenue of the managed clinics (including the franchisee and other alliance clinics) as a result of such increased competition would directly result in a reduction of the Company’s revenue since we receive substantial revenue from the MCs as part of our compensation for management services.",
        "start_character": 83523,
        "end_character": 83832
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-127557",
