        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-127557",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "A failure by the MCs and other independently operated clinics and physicians to comply with the Medical Care Act may harm our franchised brand and directly result in a reduction of the Company’s revenue, since we receive substantial revenue from the MCs as part of our compensation for management services.",
        "start_character": 109761,
        "end_character": 110067
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-127557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-127557-09d274971b1f639a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-127557",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "A failure by the MCs to comply with the APPI may harm our franchised brand and directly result in a reduction of the Company’s revenue, since we receive substantial revenue from the MCs as part of our compensation for management services.",
        "start_character": 104170,
        "end_character": 104408
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-127557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-127557-09d274971b1f639a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-127557",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "A failure by the MCs to comply with the Poisonous and Deleterious Substances Control Act may harm our franchised brand and directly result in a reduction of the Company’s revenue, since we receive substantial revenue from the MCs as part of our compensation for management services.",
        "start_character": 111202,
        "end_character": 111484
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-127557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-127557-09d274971b1f639a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-127557",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we have been able to continue to provide a high level of management services to the MCs while benefiting from the increasing number of clinics.",
        "start_character": 66178,
        "end_character": 66334
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-127557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-127557-09d274971b1f639a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-127557",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we have entered into franchise agreements and service contracts (including consulting and management service agreements) (collectively, the “Support Agreements”) with the MCs to define the scope of the management services that we provide to the MCs as well as the franchise operational provisions that the MCs must comply with.",
        "start_character": 23200,
        "end_character": 23540
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-127557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-127557-09d274971b1f639a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-127557",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we continue to grow, we expect to drive higher profitability at the corporate level by leveraging our existing support infrastructure, as we believe that as the number of the franchisee clinics that we provide management services to grows, our general and administrative costs over several years will increase at a slower rate than our revenues.",
        "start_character": 73005,
        "end_character": 73353
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-127557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-127557-09d274971b1f639a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-127557",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By comparing customer experience metrics and service offerings at (i) the clinics operated by the MCs in Japan and (ii) our clinics in Vietnam and Singapore against those of competitors, we are determining the direction to improve the competitiveness of our brand and clinic network in the market.",
        "start_character": 86756,
        "end_character": 87053
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-127557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-127557-09d274971b1f639a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-127557",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By upholding these standards, we aim to maintain and enhance our franchisees’ reputation as a trusted provider of cosmetic medical services.",
        "start_character": 69529,
        "end_character": 69669
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-127557",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-127557-09d274971b1f639a",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-127557",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, under these acts, we as a seller must explicitly show prices of products, timing and method of payment, timing of delivery, conditions for return of goods, our name and contact information, and name of representative person, among others.",
        "start_character": 114413,
        "end_character": 114664
